{%- comment -%}
  The merchandising card loop, used by the `popular` and `collection` sources of
  `product-showcase.liquid`.

  Both walk a collection's products in Liquid and apply the same three merchant
  filters, so the loop lives here rather than being written twice. The
  recommendation sources do not use it — `custom` walks the override list, and
  `related` / `recently_viewed` are filled in by `reco.js`.

  Accepts:
    block      - the block object, for exclude_current / hide_sold_out
    candidates - the sorted product list to walk
    limit      - how many cards to render
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- assign rendered = 0 -%}
{%- for item in candidates -%}
  {%- if rendered >= limit -%}
    {%- break -%}
  {%- endif -%}
  {%- if block.settings.exclude_current and product and item.id == product.id -%}
    {%- continue -%}
  {%- endif -%}
  {%- if block.settings.hide_sold_out and item.available == false -%}
    {%- continue -%}
  {%- endif -%}
  {%- render 'reco-card', reco: item, block: block -%}
  {%- assign rendered = rendered | plus: 1 -%}
{%- endfor -%}
